186/1297-9686-34-3-275 Morin, P. A., Luikart, G., & Wayne, R. K. (2004). SNPs in ecology, evolution and conservation genetics. Trends in Ecology & Evolution . DOI: 10.1016/j.tree.2004.01.009 Brumfield, R. T., Beerli, P., Nickerson, D. A., & Edwards, S. V. (2003). The utility of SNPs in population genetics inference. Trends in Ecology & Evolution . DOI: 10.1016/S0169-5347(03)00018-1 Bustin, S. A., et al. (2009). MIQE guidelines for real-time PCR experiments. Clinical Chemistry . DOI: 10.1373/clinchem.2008.112797 Heid, C. A., Stevens, J., Livak, K. J., & Williams, P. M. (1996). Real-time quantitative PCR. Genome Research . DOI: 10.1101/gr.6.10.986 Ellegren, H. (2008). Comparative genomics and genetic markers in avian species. Nature Reviews Genetics . DOI: 10.1038/nrg2361"
